ROLES AND RESPONSIBILITIES

The AI StudyBuddy application defines two primary roles: Student and Administrator. Role-based access control is implemented using JWT authentication and authorization middleware. Each role is provided with specific permissions according to its responsibilities.

1. Student

Students are the primary users of the AI StudyBuddy application. They can create an account, securely log in, upload study materials, and use AI-powered learning services.

Student Responsibilities

Students can:

Register a new account.
Log in securely using email and password.
View and update their profile.
Upload study materials.
View their uploaded materials.
Generate AI summaries.
Generate AI flashcards.
Generate AI quizzes.
Generate personalized study plans.
View previously generated learning resources.
Delete or manage their own study materials.
Access only their own private resources.
