2. Administrator

Administrators are responsible for managing the overall application. They have additional privileges that are not available to regular students.

Administrator Responsibilities

Administrators can:

View registered users.
View user information.
Manage user accounts.
Delete or deactivate inappropriate accounts.
Monitor uploaded study materials when required for system administration.
Monitor application usage.
Maintain system integrity.
Handle user-related issues.
Perform system-level management operations.
